<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25519" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαπηδ-άω</span></b> , fut.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-πηδήσομαι,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>leap across,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τάφρον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Ach.</u>
					1178
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Eq.</u>
				3.7
			</span></i>: metaph., <i>pass over lightly,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Philostr.
				<u>Her.</u>
				2.10
			</span></i>: abs., <i>take a leap,</i> of a horse, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				1.4.8
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> Medic.,
				<i>ooze through,</i> perh. 
				f.l. for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-πιδύω</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Hum.</u>
				11
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>leap apart, form a chasm,</i> of the earth, <i><span class="en">
				Lyd.
				<u>Ost.</u>
				53
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
